senses.gloss:
ARITHMETIC, s. व्यक्तं, व्यक्तगणितं, संख्याविद्या; ‘the eight rules of
arithmetic,’ परिकर्म्माष्टकं. These are, 1. Addition, सङ्कलनं;
2. Subtraction, व्यवकलनं; 3. Multiplication, गुणनं; 4. Divi-
sion, भजनं; 5. Raising to the square, वर्गः; 6. Extracting
the square-root, वर्गपदं; 7. Raising to the cube, घनः;
8. Extracting the cube-root, घनपदं.
